  <h2>Who you are buying from</h2>
  <p>Supernova is published by Anna Ignatenko, operating as an independent sole trader at Calle Alfaro 30, 3B, 46701 Gandia, Spain. Contact: support@supernova.is, +34 610 467 478.</p>

  <h2>Prices and payment</h2>
  <p>All prices are shown and charged in US dollars (USD). Payments are processed by Stripe; we never see or store your card details. Monthly reader support is billed through Substack, which also uses Stripe. Your bank statement will show our Stripe statement descriptor.</p>

  <h2>What you may do with what you buy</h2>
  <p>Digital products are licensed for your personal and professional use, including use with your own AI assistant. You may share the framework with immediate collaborators. You may not resell, republish or distribute the files, or use them for organisation-wide or commercial training without a licence — write to support@supernova.is about team and organisational use.</p>

  <h2>What these products are not</h2>
  <p>The Seven Generations Protocol, the sessions and the published material are tools for reflection and structured decision-making. They are not medical, psychological, therapeutic, financial or legal advice, and they do not replace professional services. The decision is always yours, and so are its consequences.</p>

  <h2>Eligibility</h2>
  <p>You must be 18 or older to purchase.</p>

  <h2>Refunds and cancellations</h2>
  <p>See <a href="/refunds/">Refunds, cancellations and disputes</a>, which forms part of these terms.</p>

  <h2>Promotions</h2>
  <p>Where we offer a discount or a launch price, its conditions and end date are stated with the offer.</p>

  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>We may change prices and the contents of our products. Changes do not affect a purchase already made.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by Spanish law. Nothing here limits the statutory rights of consumers in the European Union.</p>

  <h2>Payment security</h2>
  <p>This site uses HTTPS. Card payments are handled entirely by Stripe, a PCI Service Provider Level 1 certified payment processor. Card data is submitted directly to Stripe and never reaches our servers.</p>
